Unpublished work. © 2026 Siemens

To modify this gap, change the setting Worker Width in the Model Settings or the Preferences.
Reducing this gap too much can lead to unrealistic simulations due to existing safety regulations or to
the Workers carrying parts.
• When we run the simulation, we can watch the Worker walk from the WorkerPool to the staircase, climb
it, cross the overpass, and climb down the stairs on the other side.
