Model a Worker Who Queues Up
You can model Workers who walk freely within the plant and who stand in line in front of a Workplace
which they cannot enter because it is still occupied.
With the default setting of the Workplace the Workers first walk to Workplace1, then jump into the queue
in front of Workplace1, and stand in line until they can step onto it to deliver the Part.
How Workers Queue Up in Front of the Workplace describes the general mechanism in detail.
